[[31,63,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Follow the safety instructions\n(<a href=\"#/3025408\">5040</a> ).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Drain the coolant (<a href=\"#/3025410\">5040A10</a> ).</p><p><a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025960\">7210E10</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolt fixing the pipe to the condenser.</p><p>2. Disconnect the pipe connector.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Seal the disconnected connectors,\nusing suitable plugs, to prevent humidity and impurities from entering\nthe system.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004723.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolt fixing the pipe to the compressor.</p><p>2. Disconnect the nut fixing the intermediate coupling.</p><p>3. Disconnect the pipe connectors.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Seal the disconnected connectors,\nusing suitable plugs, to prevent humidity and impurities from entering\nthe system.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>4. Recover the pipe.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004724.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the pipe is not\ndamaged or cracked.</p><p>Reposition the pipe.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Replace the O-rings for the connectors.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Only use green coloured seals,\nresistant to R134A coolant fluid.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Lubricate the thread of the connectors\nusing anti-freeze.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Connect the pipe connectors and tighten\nthe bolts and the nut.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>COOLANT SYSTEM FITTINGS</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.9</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>COOLANT SYSTEM FITTINGS</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.9</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3025960\">7210E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a></p><p>Repressurize using coolant fluid (<a href=\"#/3025410\">5040A10</a> ).</p>"],[4,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Observe the following precaution.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Follow the safety instructions\n(<a href=\"#/3025408\">5040</a> ).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Drain the coolant (<a href=\"#/3024733\">0010T84</a> ).</p><p><a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025916\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025911\">7055B42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025960\">7210E10</a></p><p>1. Undo the nut fastening the intermediate coupling for the pipe\nfrom the climate control casing to the compressor.</p><p>2. Disconnect the intermediate coupling.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Seal the housing for the drier\nfilter cartridge using a suitable plug to prevent dampness and impurities\nfrom entering the system.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2048802.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,63,0,"<p>1. Working in front of the right front wheel, release the buttons\nretaining the air duct using the special tool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Scraper blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.823.015.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolts fixing the air duct.</p><p>3. Remove the air duct.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2048803.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,63,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolt and disconnect the connector (1a) for the pipe\nfrom the condenser (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2048804.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,63,0,"<p>1. Working under the engine, undo the bolt and disconnect the connector\n(1a) for the pipe from the compressor (1b).</p><p>2. Remove the pipe</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2048805.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the pipe is not damaged or cracked.</p><p>Position the pipe.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Replace the O-rings for the connectors.\nOnly use green coloured seals, resistant to R134A refrigerant. Lubricate\nthe thread of the connectors using anti-freeze.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Connect the pipe connectors and tighten\nthe bolts and the nut.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>COOLANT SYSTEM FITTINGS</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.9</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>COOLANT SYSTEM FITTINGS</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.9</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Fit the air duct in place and secure it\nusing the bolts.</p><p>Engage the air duct retaining buttons.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025960\">7210E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025911\">7055B42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025916\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a></p><p>Repressurize using coolant fluid (<a href=\"#/3024733\">0010T84</a> ).</p>"]]